              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Flag names or values reveal products or features that have not been announced."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Flag names or values reveal products or features that have not been announced.\n\nFix: Rename pre-launch flags to neutral names and mark them server-side only.",
                "markdown": "**Unreleased product details are visible in client flags.**\n\nFlag names or values reveal products or features that have not been announced.\n\n**Fix:** Rename pre-launch flags to neutral names and mark them server-side only."
