          "ruleIndex": 2,
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "Anyone can retry identifiers until they unlock the early-access AI feature: The early_access_ai flag is meant for a small test group (about 9% of users). Anyone with the public client key can send made-up user identifiers and see which ones get the feature switched on. After roughly 11 tries, one succeeds."
          },
